{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>narrative-driven first-person exploration and puzzle game</strong> in which three animal-like teenagers embark on a <strong>journey of self-discovery</strong> as they wander the mystical Sanctuary of the Old Well, <strong>uncovering its history and meeting other curious visitors</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a severe fire and a hurried restoration, the Old Well sanctuary finally reopens its doors. Home to the well whose water has long been linked to a series of superstitions about \u201cstarting anew,\u201d the natural park\u2019s reopening draws all kinds of anthropomorphic animals who wish to turn their lives around... or simply take a pleasant stroll through nature, far from their daily worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The grand opening unexpectedly reunites three teenagers who, despite once being quite close, lost touch after finishing compulsory secondary school. As they get to know each other better and reflect on where their lives are headed, they begin to sense that the sanctuary may have a life of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key aspects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open-ended exploration that externalizes the <strong>protagonists\u2019 inner discovery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Audio-oriented puzzles</strong> \u201chidden\u201d in the environment which are closely intertwined with the protagonists\u2019 development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive soundtrack and experimental retro art direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lighthearted yet introspective <strong>coming-of-age story</strong> that explores the contemporary tensions between <strong>tradition and modernity</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637250?t=1744754190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637250?t=1744754190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/8002123d96118ec4b969167d1cd7d280cda39b47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744754190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/8002123d96118ec4b969167d1cd7d280cda39b47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744754190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>narrative-driven first-person exploration and puzzle game</strong> in which three animal-like teenagers embark on a <strong>journey of self-discovery</strong> as they wander the mystical Sanctuary of the Old Well, <strong>uncovering its history and meeting other curious visitors</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a severe fire and a hurried restoration, the Old Well sanctuary finally reopens its doors. Home to the well whose water has long been linked to a series of superstitions about \u201cstarting anew,\u201d the natural park\u2019s reopening draws all kinds of anthropomorphic animals who wish to turn their lives around... or simply take a pleasant stroll through nature, far from their daily worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The grand opening unexpectedly reunites three teenagers who, despite once being quite close, lost touch after finishing compulsory secondary school. As they get to know each other better and reflect on where their lives are headed, they begin to sense that the sanctuary may have a life of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key aspects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open-ended exploration that externalizes the <strong>protagonists\u2019 inner discovery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Audio-oriented puzzles</strong> \u201chidden\u201d in the environment which are closely intertwined with the protagonists\u2019 development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive soundtrack and experimental retro art direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lighthearted yet introspective <strong>coming-of-age story</strong> that explores the contemporary tensions between <strong>tradition and modernity</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["BIG STRETCH"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637250/9df92e8d8bfb0f1a3fb2e3133558891bd36e8e4e/header.jpg?t=1744754190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123444,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123444/movie480.mp4?t=1744658900","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123444/movie_max.mp4?t=1744658900"},"name":"Now Play This Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123444/0f21b2146f588ab6377effb032746e3829b02a23/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744658900","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123444/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744658900","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123444/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744658900"}}],"name":"The Well's Blessing","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 or AMD Radeon R7 370<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul